        <mxCell id="legend-ablation" value="Scientific ablations — current implementation map&#10;A0 [READY] — Current default configuration; record the full config for each control run.&#10;A1 [PENDING] — model.warp_fit='separate': separate output-warp fit; currently raises NotImplementedError.&#10;A2 [READY] — acquisition.scale='original' / 'latent'. Use evaluation='qmc' in both arms to isolate scale; auto also changes evaluator.&#10;A3 [PENDING] — Post-search novelty instead of a GA constraint. DI: CandidateSearch via search._target_; no built-in switch.&#10;A4 [PENDING] — Last-generation front instead of cumulative front. DI: CandidateSearch via search._target_; no built-in switch.&#10;A5 [HEBO] [READY] — model.output_transform='standardize' disables nonlinear output warping, retaining standardization.&#10;A6 [READY] — model.gate=False disables the YJ gate/refit in SimpleModel.train_model(), inherited by both other models.&#10;A7 [PARTIAL] — acquisition._target_='qMACE', q&gt;=2. Joint AF and predefined discrete batches work; evolutionary q-batches are pending.&#10;A8 [HEBO] [READY] — model.input_warp=False disables nonlinear input warping, retaining encoding and normalization.&#10;A9 [HEBO] [READY] — acquisition._target_='LogEI' / 'EI' versus 'MACE'. Use a common discrete pool to isolate AF from search choice.&#10;A10 [HEBO] [EXCLUDED] — HEBO noise robustness was explicitly removed from scope. No robustness or robust_noise_std setting.&#10;A11 [READY] — MACE evaluator: analytic/qMC for Gaussian utility; quadrature/qMC for raw YJ. Native EI/LogEI are analytic.&#10;[HEBO] identifies a factor in the earlier HEBO study plan; this is not an exact replication claim.&#10;Historical H0-H4 add-one controls are not provided as presets; robustness controls are excluded.&#10;READY means an available code path, not a completed experimental study. Keep S settings fixed for A comparisons." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=23;fontColor=#334155;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="2363.0" width="3440" height="604" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LayeredSearch" value="LayeredSearch : CandidateSearch&#10;_target_ = layered&#10;point_pre_init → small_batches_ga&#10;_initialize → batches_ga&#10;See page: Layered search" vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#dfefe4;strokeColor=#52677c;fontSize=20;">
          <mxGeometry x="3150" y="540" width="370" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
