        </object>
        <object id="marker-PymooSearch" label="S6 [PARTIAL]&#10;Budget ready; HV patience pending" umlKind="marker" targetClass="PymooSearch">
          <mxCell vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=19;fontStyle=1;strokeColor=#94a3b8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;">
            <mxGeometry x="2540.0" y="1510.0" width="590.0" height="78" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </object>
        <mxCell id="legend-speed" value="Speed variants — current implementation map&#10;S1 [READY] — model._target_='joint' / 'centered' / 'profiled'; GP calculation is injected through BaseMLL.&#10;     centered_init='preserve_mean' preserves physical m; zero_beta changes initialization. Hold the starting state fixed for fair comparisons.&#10;S2 [READY] — model.warm_start. tidyHEBO._train_surrogate() stores state_dict; train_model / _load_model_state transfer learned parameters only.&#10;     Data-dependent statistics, posterior caches and solver history are not carried across BO steps.&#10;S3a [PARTIAL] — MACE quadrature already shares one posterior and constructs nodes once per AF. Additional cache_invariants / reuse_inverse_warp flags are pending.&#10;S3b [PENDING] — acquisition.posterior='frozen_q1' is not implemented. Native GPyTorch posterior caching within one fitted model remains available.&#10;S4 [READY, FIXED] — ParetoAccumulator keeps only the exact cumulative feasible front; no population history or approximate cap. No config toggle.&#10;S5 [DEFERRED] — GA warm start is absent. No previous_fraction or population reuse setting.&#10;S6 [PARTIAL] — search.max_generations with search.stop.mode='budget' works. mode='hv_patience' raises NotImplementedError.&#10;     check_every, patience and tolerances belong to the pending HV path. No min_generations setting.&#10;No measured speedup is asserted by this map. Pending switches fail explicitly rather than silently running the default path." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=23;fontColor=#334155;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="2338.0" width="3440" height="468" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LayeredSearch" value="LayeredSearch : CandidateSearch&#10;_target_ = layered&#10;point_pre_init → small_batches_ga&#10;_initialize → batches_ga&#10;See page: Layered search" vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#dfefe4;strokeColor=#52677c;fontSize=20;">
          <mxGeometry x="3150" y="540" width="370" height="210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LayeredSearch-inherits" edge="1" parent="1" source="LayeredSearch" target="BaseSearch" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;endArrow=block;endFill=0;strokeColor=#52677c;">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
