        <mxCell id="gate-config-location" value="A6 / use_gate: ModelConfig(gate=False); path: config.model.gate&#10;SimpleModel.train_model() skips the output-warp gate/refit.&#10;The current fixed gate threshold is std(train_targets) &lt; 0.5.&#10;The gate only applies when nonlinear YJ warping is active." vertex="1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=15;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="1080" width="1080" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="config-contract" value="Runtime constraints&#10;MACE: q=1. qMACE: q&gt;=2 with qMC; discrete batches use MultiIndex (batch, point).&#10;LogEI/EI: Gaussian utility; YJ requires latent scale. Scalar gradient search is continuous only.&#10;GA: vector AF, q=1, budget stopping. Separate warp, frozen_q1 and HV patience are pending.&#10;RegistryConfig is a structural Protocol; concrete configs do not inherit it.&#10;The optimizer maximizes. There is no direction, selection, global seed or GA warm-start setting." vertex="1" parent="1" style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=23;fontColor=#334155;">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="1790" width="2280" height="300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
